{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Landomayzer&quot; is a first-person adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I have been chosen by the \u201cQueen.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether by design or by chance, I must swiftly complete the tasks given to me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city we live in is ruled by the \u201cQueen,\u201d and her orders are absolute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From this moment, I must fulfill my role.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Game Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A walking simulator where various events unfold as you move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examine objects to progress the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no in-game text.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No quest markers or time limits \u2014 you can play at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wherever the \u201cQueen\u201d is, there is always a \u201cQueen Candidate\u201d nearby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: 20\u201360 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Streaming Guidelines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming is allowed without prior permission, both for individuals and companies.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4035130?t=1758751721","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4035130?t=1758751721","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035130/e8eec24e26dbae285360cd4c0bbe10914c671b99/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758751721","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035130/e8eec24e26dbae285360cd4c0bbe10914c671b99/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758751721","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Landomayzer&quot; is a first-person adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I have been chosen by the \u201cQueen.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether by design or by chance, I must swiftly complete the tasks given to me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city we live in is ruled by the \u201cQueen,\u201d and her orders are absolute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From this moment, I must fulfill my role.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Game Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A walking simulator where various events unfold as you move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examine objects to progress the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no in-game text.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No quest markers or time limits \u2014 you can play at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wherever the \u201cQueen\u201d is, there is always a \u201cQueen Candidate\u201d nearby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: 20\u201360 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Streaming Guidelines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming is allowed without prior permission, both for individuals and companies.</p>","developers":["Lu"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035130/12a8bff1da54ed77ad147bf78c7471cde6264bd6/header.jpg?t=1758751721","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4035130/926812903/4c63f511c0aa13e9b87ec3c703d74cab58602f3b/1758408599/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758751719","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4035130/926812903/4c63f511c0aa13e9b87ec3c703d74cab58602f3b/1758408599/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758751719","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.c